{"id":"n72461-1-14","stage":3,"title":"한자 · 汉字","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72461-1-14-1","ko":"지수야, 이 한자 무슨 글자인지 알아?","zh":"智秀，你知道这个汉字是什么意思吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"한자","meaning":"汉字","explanation":"한자：汉字。","readings":[{"term":"한자","audio":"/audio/2ec27660c6fa3c0acc73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72461","senseId":"1","lemma":"한자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한자","audio":"/audio/2ec27660c6fa3c0acc73.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"글자인지","meaning":"字，文字","explanation":"글자：字，文字；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62490","senseId":"1","lemma":"글자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글자인지","audio":"/audio/83768712c92d3bd20faa.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아","audio":"/audio/afb5239ccd10c522dc68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2ec27660c6fa3c0a","term":"한자","zh":"汉字","audio":"/audio/2ec27660c6fa3c0acc73.mp3","entryId":"72461","definition":"由中国创造，并且现在仍在使用的中国特有的文字。","pronunciation":["한ː짜"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"068c2631228200cf","term":"글자","zh":"字，文字","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3","entryId":"62490","definition":"记录语言的符号。","pronunciation":["글짜"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a4faa5da820eff2cabf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72461-1-14-2","ko":"나도 잘 모르겠어. 옥편을 찾아 봐.","zh":"我也不知道。去查查字典吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}},{"text":"옥편을","meaning":"玉篇","explanation":"옥편：玉篇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옥편","audio":"/audio/9a14a5191cf20d519527.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68605","senseId":"1","lemma":"옥편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옥편을","audio":"/audio/e0c3f40f83adff26a568.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아","meaning":"查找，搜索","explanation":"찾다：查找，搜索；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"3","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아","audio":"/audio/e70a628817a54f0ec6b0.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"9a14a5191cf20d51","term":"옥편","zh":"玉篇","audio":"/audio/9a14a5191cf20d519527.mp3","entryId":"68605","definition":"按照一定顺序编排汉字，注释每一个汉字的读音和含义的书。","pronunciation":["옥편"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"查找，搜索","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了弄清不懂的东西而查看书或查电脑。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（